*> PLB-C046 overlapping-move: a MOVE whose sender and receiver share
*> storage.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. OVERLAP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  CUSTOMER-REC.
    05  CUST-NAME       PIC X(20).
    05  CUST-CITY       PIC X(20).
01  CUST-WHOLE REDEFINES CUSTOMER-REC PIC X(40).
01  SHIFTED REDEFINES CUSTOMER-REC.
    05  FILLER          PIC X(5).
    05  SHIFT-NAME      PIC X(20).
    05  FILLER          PIC X(15).
01  TABLE-AREA.
    05  ITEM            PIC X(4) OCCURS 10.
01  OTHER-REC           PIC X(20).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE CUST-NAME TO SHIFT-NAME
    MOVE CUST-WHOLE TO CUST-CITY
    MOVE CUST-NAME TO CUST-CITY
    MOVE CUST-NAME TO OTHER-REC
    MOVE CUST-NAME TO CUST-NAME
    MOVE ITEM(1) TO ITEM(2)
    STOP RUN.
